  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.01",
    "summary": "Each TRANSPORT model’s datasheet gives a transport capacity, which sets which friendly models may embark in it and how many. Several units may be embarked in one TRANSPORT model simultaneously, as long as its capacity allows. While declaring battle formations before the battle, your units may begin embarked in any friendly TRANSPORT model with enough capacity left for the entire unit. Every friendly DEDICATED TRANSPORT model needs a friendly unit embarked in it; once that step ends, any that has none is destroyed, without setting off any on-destruction rules.",
